Package: econcompare
Type: Package
Title: Econometric Model Comparison for Cross-Sectional and Time-Series Data
Version: 0.11.0
Authors@R: person("econcompare", "contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "maintainer@example.com")
Description: A research-software toolkit for exploring and comparing econometric models
    across cross-sectional and explanatory time-series settings. Cross-sectional models are
    grouped by dependent-variable objective. Time-series tools conservatively detect and audit
    temporal indices, distinguish calendar gaps from observation ordering, and support static temporal regression, distributed lags, dynamic
    regression, ARDL-style finite lag specifications, single-equation error-correction models,
    and multivariate VAR/VECM systems for studying relationships among variables over time
    rather than forecasting. The package provides pre-model exploration,
    explicit diagnostics, a programmatic API, and an interactive Shiny workspace while
    preserving researcher control over modelling choices.
